# The release channels of the Nyx toolchain.
#
# `nyx upgrade` fetches this file from the distribution repository. One line per channel that is
# actually published; a channel with no line is *not published yet*, which `nyx upgrade` reports as
# such rather than as "up to date".
#
#     channel <name> <version> ["<archive URL>"] [notes]
#
# The four channels, from least to most adventurous:
#
#   Stable        what most people should run.
#   Preview       published more often than Stable, expected to work.
#   Beta          features are still moving; behaviour can change between builds.
#   TestEdition   the bleeding edge: may not build a program at all.
#
# The archive holds `bin/nyx` (or `bin/nyx.exe`) plus the toolchain's `lib/`, so an installation is a
# directory rather than a bare executable — the standard library is Nyx source, and the compiler
# resolves it from `lib/` at compile time. Omitting the URL publishes only the version: users are told
# a release exists and nothing is fetched, which is the right shape for a channel whose builds are not
# ready to hand out.
#
# Versions are compared as dotted numbers, and a `-suffix` sorts *before* its release, so
# `3.14.0-beta.2` is older than `3.14.0`. That is what makes the Beta channel usable: a beta never
# replaces the release it precedes.
#
# The archives are attached to GitHub Releases rather than committed here, so this repository stays
# small enough to read in a browser.

channel Stable      3.13.0  "https://github.com/jiayin0113-afk/nyx-dist/releases/download/v3.13.0/nyx-3.13.0-windows-x86_64.tar.gz"  current release
channel Preview     3.13.0  "https://github.com/jiayin0113-afk/nyx-dist/releases/download/v3.13.0/nyx-3.13.0-windows-x86_64.tar.gz"  same build as Stable while Preview is being set up
channel Beta        3.14.0-beta.2  "https://github.com/jiayin0113-afk/nyx-dist/releases/download/v3.14.0-beta.2/nyx-3.14.0-beta.2-windows-x86_64.tar.gz"  union types, macros, transitive package resolution
channel TestEdition 3.15.0-test.1  ""  published, no archive yet: the branch is not building
